# Keeps the local sandbox image build (`make sandbox-image`, docker/sandbox/Dockerfile,
# ADR-038) from sending the whole repo as build context to the local Docker daemon —
# the Dockerfile only COPYs pyproject.toml/uv.lock*/README.md/src/, so nothing else here
# is ever needed inside the image, but without this file it's still transferred to the
# daemon on every build. Flagged by the architecture-reviewer agent's 2026-08-26 review
# of the Docker sandbox migration (non-blocking hygiene note, not a security finding —
# .env is gitignored and was not present in the build context regardless).

.git/
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
frontend/
.claude/
docs/
case_study/
tests/
*.md
.env
.env.local
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
